<space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>-<gt><space><quote>Family<comma><space>I.<space><openparen>Organisation<closeparen><quote><lf><lf><space><space><space><space>Special<space>rule:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space>If<space>ALL<space>authors<space>are<space>organisations<comma><space>no<space>comma<space>before<space><apos><amp><apos>.<lf><space><space><space><space><quote><quote><quote><lf><space><space><space><space>authors<space>=<space><openbracket><closebracket><lf><space><space><space><space>all_orgs_only<space>=<space>True<lf><lf><space><space><space><space>for<space>family<comma><space>given<comma><space>organisation<space>in<space>author_tuples:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>family<space>=<space><openparen>family<space>or<space><quote><quote><closeparen>.strip<openparen><closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>given<space>=<space><openparen>given<space>or<space><quote><quote><closeparen>.strip<openparen><closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>organisation<space>=<space><openparen>organisation<space>or<space><quote><quote><closeparen>.strip<openparen><closeparen><lf><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>person<space>=<space><quote><quote><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>if<space>family<space>or<space>given:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>all_orgs_only<space>=<space>False<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>initials<space>=<space>build_initials<openparen>given<closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>if<space>family<space>and<space>initials:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>person<space>=<space>f<quote><opencurly>family<closecurly><comma><space><opencurly>initials<closecurly><quote><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>elif<space>family:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>person<space>=<space>family<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>elif<space>initials:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>person<space>=<space>initials<lf><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>if<space>person<space>and<space>organisation:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>authors.append<openparen>f<quote><opencurly>person<closecurly><space><openparen><opencurly>organisation<closecurly><closeparen><quote><closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>all_orgs_only<space>=<space>False<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>elif<space>person:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>authors.append<openparen>person<closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>elif<space>organisation:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>authors.append<openparen>organisation<closeparen><lf><lf><space><space><space><space>if<space>all_orgs_only:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>return<space>_conjoin_organisations<openparen>authors<closeparen><lf><lf><space><space><space><space>return<space>_conjoin_apa_people<openparen>authors<closeparen><lf><lf><lf>#<space>----------------------------------------------------------------------<lf>#<space>FeatureProcessor<space><openparen>FME<space>entry<space>point<closeparen><lf>#<space>----------------------------------------------------------------------<lf><lf>class<space>FeatureProcessor:<lf><space><space><space><space>def<space>__init__<openparen>self<closeparen>:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>pass<lf><lf><space><space><space><space>def<space>input<openparen>self<comma><space>feature<closeparen>:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>#<space>--------------------------------------------------------------<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>#<space>1.<space>Discover<space>author<space>indices<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>#<space>--------------------------------------------------------------<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>indices<space>=<space>set<openparen><closeparen><lf><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>for<space>name<space>in<space>feature.getAllAttributeNames<openparen><closeparen>:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>if<space>name.startswith<openparen><quote>author<opencurly><quote><closeparen><space>and<space><quote><closecurly><quote><space>in<space>name:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>try:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>idx<space>=<space>int<openparen>name.split<openparen><quote><opencurly><quote><comma><space>1<closeparen><openbracket>1<closebracket>.split<openparen><quote><closecurly><quote><comma><space>1<closeparen><openbracket>0<closebracket><closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>indices.add<openparen>idx<closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>except<space>ValueError:<lf><space><space><space><space><space